repository-code: "https://github.com/OWNER/gopro-real-time"
abstract: >-
  A Windows application that recovers the true wall-clock recording time of
  GoPro footage from embedded metadata, annotates experimental phases from the
  timestamps of marker photographs, and extracts labelled trial clips for
  behavioural analysis. Timestamps are rendered as subtitle tracks or burned
  into the image; trial clips are produced by lossless stream copy with
  re-timed subtitles and an auditable manifest.
